WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.461 --> 00:00:07.193
Intake brings work in from Jira or GitHub. Your business analyst reads the ticket and turns it into cards.

2
00:00:07.898 --> 00:00:16.892
Open Intake in the sidebar. Paste a ticket key, an issue link, or just describe what you need. The page shows what it detected.

3
00:00:17.591 --> 00:00:27.086
Tell your CEO hands it to your CEO in its chat, and the CEO takes it from there. Work with the BA directly opens a conversation with your business analyst.

4
00:00:27.789 --> 00:00:34.161
The BA reads the ticket and maps it to a project. It asks only what it cannot decide.

5
00:00:34.861 --> 00:00:41.593
Nothing was missing here, so it drafted the card straight away. It is listed on the right, ready for the team.

6
00:00:42.296 --> 00:00:50.142
For many tickets at once, switch to Batch. Paste one ticket per line, and choose a project or let the BA decide.

7
00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:55.695
The BA works through the batch in the background, and asks on the desk when it is stuck.

8
00:00:56.394 --> 00:01:02.652
Earlier intakes and batches stay listed on the Intake page, so you can pick any conversation up again.
